{"ref":"BDB Aramaic, מַנְדַּע","hw":"מַנְדַּע","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">מַנְדַּע</span></big>  <strong>n.</strong> [<strong>m.</strong>] <strong>knowledge, power of knowing (</strong>𝔗<sup>J</sup> id.<em>;</em> Syriac <span dir=\"rtl\">ܡܰܕܥܳܐ</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">ܡܽܘܕܥܳܐ</span>; BH <span dir=\"rtl\">מַדָּע</span> (late); cf. ‘Mandâ’ = γνῶσις, Nö<sup>M xx</sup><strong>)</strong>;—abs. <a data-ref=\"Daniel 5:12\" href=\"/Daniel.5.12\">Dn 5:12</a>; emph. -<span dir=\"rtl\">דְּעָא</span> <a data-ref=\"Daniel 2:21\" href=\"/Daniel.2.21\">2:21</a>; sf. -<span dir=\"rtl\">דְּעִי</span> <a data-ref=\"Daniel 4:31\" href=\"/Daniel.4.31\">4:31</a>, <a data-ref=\"Daniel 4:33\" href=\"/Daniel.4.33\">33</a>.","next":"BDB Aramaic, יְהַב","prev":"BDB Aramaic, יְדַע"}